{"text":"夫抗音投澗，美惡必酬；振服依河，長短交目。斯乃德音道俗，水鏡古今。法生儌逢孝文皇帝專心於三寶，又遇北海母子崇信於二京。妙演之際，屢叨末筵；一降淨心，忝充五戒。思樹芥子，庶幾須彌。今爲孝文并北海母子造像表情，以申接遇。法生構始王家，助終夙霄，締敬歸功帝王，萬品衆生，一切同福。魏景明四年十二月一日，比丘法生爲孝文皇帝并北海王母子造。清信士元寶意、清信士元善意、弟子北海王元伏榮、比丘僧隆、比丘僧道、比丘尼明惠、比丘尼法真、□□□□□。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Cultural_Term","term":"明鑑","refId":null,"text":"水鏡","start":28,"end":30},{"name":"PersonName","term":"法生","refId":null,"text":"法生","start":33,"end":35},{"name":"PersonName","term":"孝文皇帝","refId":null,"text":"孝文皇帝","start":37,"end":41},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三寶","refId":null,"text":"三寶","start":44,"end":46},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"五戒","refId":null,"text":"五戒","start":76,"end":78},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"芥子","refId":null,"text":"芥子","start":81,"end":83},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"須彌山","refId":null,"text":"須彌","start":86,"end":88},{"name":"PersonName","term":"法生","refId":null,"text":"法生","start":108,"end":110},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":129,"end":131},{"name":"PersonName","term":"法生","refId":null,"text":"法生","start":150,"end":152},{"name":"PersonName","term":"孝文皇帝","refId":null,"text":"孝文皇帝","start":153,"end":157},{"name":"PersonName","term":"元寶意","refId":null,"text":"元寶意","start":168,"end":171},{"name":"PersonName","term":"元善意","refId":null,"text":"元善意","start":175,"end":178},{"name":"PersonName","term":"北海王元伏榮","refId":null,"text":"北海王元伏榮","start":181,"end":187},{"name":"PersonName","term":"僧隆","refId":null,"text":"僧隆","start":190,"end":192},{"name":"PersonName","term":"僧道","refId":null,"text":"僧道","start":195,"end":197},{"name":"PersonName","term":"明惠","refId":null,"text":"明惠","start":201,"end":203},{"name":"PersonName","term":"法真","refId":null,"text":"法真","start":207,"end":209}]}